---
// Footer.astro - Minimalist Web3 Protocol Footer
---

<footer class="w-full bg-transparent px-6 sm:px-10 pb-6 sm:pb-8 select-none">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-2.5 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400">
    <!-- Left: Identity & Year -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-neutral-950 font-medium tracking-wide">2026 QuantX</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-300">//</span>
      <span class="tracking-wider">AUTONOMOUS PROTOCOL</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Licensing & Status -->
    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[11px] tracking-wider">
      <span class="hidden sm:inline">MIT LICENSE</span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-neutral-300">//</span>
      <span class="text-neutral-600 flex items-center gap-1.5">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 pulse-emerald inline-block"></span>
        SYSTEM OPERATIONAL
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
